"""``execute_alr_run`` — the durable ALR run orchestrator core (plan §5-§6; ADR 0010).

Ties together the versioned run request/result contracts
(``src/contracts/alr_run.py``), the Phase 3.2 deterministic rules engine
(``src/alr_engine/rules.py``), the Phase 3.5-3.7 AI-issue post-processing /
model-stage deterministic boundary (``src/alr_engine/ai_issue_post.py``,
``issue_quality.py``, ``model_stage.py``), the Phase 3.8 model-provider seam
(``src/alr_run/model_invoker.py``), and the Phase 3.3 durable run ledger
(``src/run_ledger``) into the ``run-advertising-legal-review-v1`` AgentCore
action's core logic. ``src/alr_run/agentcore_action.py`` is the thin plain-
dict-in/out wrapper around this module.

No LLM/provider SDK imports, no ``backend/``/``frontend/`` imports, no direct
``time.time()``/``datetime.now()``/``uuid.uuid4()``/bare
``random.random()``/``random.randint()`` calls anywhere in this module: every
timestamp flows through ``deps.clock`` (consumed indirectly via the ledger/
audit-chain writer, both of which are already clock-injected) and every
"random" value flows through ``deps.rng``. Model calls flow ONLY through the
injected ``deps.model_invoker`` (``ModelInvoker`` Protocol) -- no provider SDK
import here either.

Phase 3.8 (model-stage wiring) is strictly additive: ``AlrRunDeps.model_invoker``
defaults to ``None``, and when it is ``None`` every asset runs EXACTLY the four
Phase 3.4 deterministic ledger stages (``normalize_context``,
``deterministic_checks``, ``required_disclaimers``, ``contextual_rules``) as
before -- zero model stages, byte-identical behaviour to Phase 3.4. When an
invoker IS provided, ``_process_asset`` additionally runs the model-stage
pipeline (``_run_model_stage_pipeline``): ComplianceSpec extraction (advisory)
-> text review (conditional-required) -> suppress+prune (required,
deterministic) -> LLM verify (advisory) -> ``finalize_issue_quality``
(required, deterministic), mirroring the model-call slice of
``runMarketingReviewOnManifest`` (backend/marketing-review.js) that follows
Node's ``runDeterministicChecksWithRuleStudio``. See
``src/alr_run/model_invoker.py``'s module docstring for the documented vision-
review cut.
"""

